{
  "name": "KPL SAB 赛制 / KPL SAB League Format",
  "author": "L-ku",
  "version": "1.6.4",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每组三个单循环（45 场），每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组（含卡位赛 BO7），赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）加 7-10 名排位，推送最终名次与对阵新闻，并修正国际杯抽签的挂名队与重复席位。每个赛段开始（春季开档、夏季 6/22 转会期）先随机抽签分三组；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起为 S 组/A 组/B 组，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」——命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。底部「季后赛」按钮可展开完整 16 场对阵面板（轮次、日期时刻、队徽、实时比分），绕开原生页面只有 8 个卡位的问题，赛后推送当日战报。中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队与新生成选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。S/A/B 为同一联赛级别，不再有 S↔A 升降级、降级履历或赞助层级惩罚；B↔K甲 升降级保留。\n\n1.6.4 修复国际杯抽签崩溃（0.6.5 与新版都会中招）。两个独立原因：① B 组季后赛槽被清空后又在同一次调用里被标成 finalized，补槽逻辑只看未 finalize 的容器，于是永远补不上 —— B 组算不出 1-6 名，中国赛区在东区申请的 4 个名额少了 2 个，抽签池只剩 14 队，最后一个 pot 只有 2 队就崩了。现在先补槽再 finalize。② 读取「当前年份」的内存偏移随更新挪了位置，年份永远匹配不上，名额归一化整段静默失效。现在年份改从分配表条目内部读取（结构体自身布局，不随版本变化），不再依赖其它 world 偏移。\n1.6.3 兼容 0.7.0 的 Expansion 开档模式（在二级联赛新建空阵容球队）与经理跳槽：新建的球队不再被误判成挂名队（之前会被清零转会预算、并被踢进 K甲）；分组抽签也不再因为「不是正好 30 支队」就整段放弃，免得挂名队一直留在积分榜上。\n1.6.2 性能优化：每个管理回合对比赛的读取从上千次降到几十次（新增按回合的读取缓存，同一批记录只读一次），挂名队预算已为 0 时不再重复写入（此前每回合都把队伍记录标脏），转会期一批事件的中文名扫描只跑一次。推挡明显变快，赛制逻辑与结果完全不变。\n1.6.1 修复能力值显示：引擎详情页 OVR 实际是「11 项技能值 + 主分路」的平均（自我不计入），旧版按 ovr/80 等比缩放，而五套分路模板均值只有 70-75，导致 91 分的选手只显示 81，且对抗路/游走偏低最多、球员排序会变。现改为按分路模板反解缩放系数并补齐零头，详情页 OVR 与名单评分完全一致，同时保留每个位置的强弱特征。\n1.6.0 统计窗口扩到 2023 春至 2026 夏共十季；荣誉改为在数据分之上加分（旧写法会让无冠选手凭空被扣 30%），补齐每届总决赛 FMVP 与赛季 MVP。结果：小胖 92、长生 92、轩染 91、一诺 90。\n1.5.0 能力值改为 11 项官方数据按分路加权、同赛季同分路取百分位，生涯荣誉按赛事等级与时间加权并入；挂名队禁止买人。\n1.4.0 16 队换成 2026 KPL 夏季赛真实大名单，年龄按真实出生日期、潜力按年龄区间随机；修复「同一支队每次开档选手不一样」。\n1.3.0 新增完整 16 场季后赛面板与每日战报。\n1.2.x S/A/B 同级、每赛段随机抽签、分组显示名。\n1.1.0 中国赛区全中文名。\n建议与 KPL + Real LoL Teams 数据包一起使用。\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: three single round-robins per group (45 matches), per-round standings reset with regrouping (plus BO7 card matches), and a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff (16 matches) with 7-10 placement games. Final-rank and bracket news are pushed, and international-cup draws get their placeholder teams and duplicate seats fixed. Each split opens with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer window for Summer); round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\" — display-only, never touching league ids, regions or standings. A \"Playoffs\" button opens a full 16-match bracket panel (round, date/time, logos, live scores), working around the native pages' 8-slot limit, with a daily report after each playoff day. Every CN athlete (second division, academy and newly generated) gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing stats. S, A and B share one league tier: no S-to-A promotion/relegation, relegation tags or tier-based sponsor penalties; B-to-K甲 promotion is kept.\n\n1.6.4 fixes the international-cup draw crash (`index out of bounds: len 2 index 2`, hit on both 0.6.5 and current builds) caused by two independent bugs: (a) group B's playoff slots were cleared and group B force-finalised in the same call, but the back-fill routine only looks at non-finalised containers, so B could never be refilled — it then produced no ranks 1-6, CN lost 2 of its 4 Challengers-East slots, the pool shrank to 14 teams and the last pot of 2 went out of bounds. The back-fill now runs before finalising. (b) The memory offset used to read the current year moved in a game update, so the year never matched and the per-region slot normalisation silently did nothing. The year is now read from inside the allocation entries themselves (struct-local layout, version independent), removing the dependency on other world offsets. Draws now work on both 0.6.5 and 0.7.0 beta.\n1.6.3 supports 0.7.0's Expansion start (a brand-new empty club in the second division) and manager moves: a newly created team is no longer mistaken for a placeholder (it used to get its transfer budget zeroed and be pushed down to the K甲), and the group draw no longer gives up whenever the roster is not exactly 30 teams, which used to leave the placeholder teams sitting in the standings.\n1.6.2 is a performance pass: a management turn now reads each match a few dozen times instead of over a thousand (a per-turn read cache serves every batch of records once), placeholder teams are no longer rewritten every turn once their budgets already read 0 (which kept dirtying team records), and the Chinese-name scan during a transfer window runs once per batch instead of once per event. Advancing a day is noticeably faster; the format logic and results are unchanged.\n1.6.1 fixes the displayed rating: the engine computes OVR as the average of the eleven skill stats plus the main-lane stat (ego excluded), while the old code scaled the lane template by ovr/80 and the templates average only 70-75, so a 91-rated player showed as 81 and top/support players were penalised most, changing the sort order. The formula now solves the scale factor per lane and evens out rounding, so the in-game OVR matches the roster rating exactly while keeping each lane's character.\n1.6.0 extends the window to ten seasons (2023 Spring - 2026 Summer) and adds honours on top of the data score instead of scaling it (the old formula shaved 30% off every titleless player), covering every Finals MVP and season MVP. Results: 小胖 92, 长生 92, 轩染 91, 一诺 90.\n1.5.0 recomputes ratings from eleven official metrics, percentiled within season and lane with lane weights, folding in career honours weighted by event tier and recency; placeholder teams can no longer sign players.\n1.4.0 switches all 16 teams to the real 2026 KPL Summer roster, with real birth dates and age-banded random potential, and fixes rosters varying between saves.\n1.3.0 adds the full 16-match playoff panel and daily reports.\n1.2.x same tier for S/A/B, per-split random draw, group display names.\n1.1.0 Chinese names across the CN region.\nBest used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-25",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.0"
    }
  ]
}
